# Golden G-M1-2: mute and solo masks over one pattern cycle.
# Both tracks hit step 1. First beat: b muted -> only a sounds.
# Then solo a while unmuting b -> still only a sounds.
port open out synth
track new a synth:1
track new b synth:2
track length a 4
track length b 4
track step a 1 C4 100 60
track step b 1 E4 100 60
track mute b on
transport start
advance 959
track solo a on
track mute b off
advance 960
transport stop
quit
